      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, thanks. I'm particularly worried about \"bad actors\" in the industry—suppliers who might try to exploit loopholes or act in bad faith when things get tight. Are there specific ways we can draft the \"Force Majeure\" or \"Default/Breach\" sections to specifically account for these types of hidden risks or deceptive behaviors?",
